        "operationId": "getRun",
        "summary": "Get status and permitted run data",
        "tags": ["Runs"],
        "description": "Requires runs:read, ownership and retained workflow/version grant. Inaccessible IDs return 404 before engine access. Input/output is omitted unless fields are allowed, with nested secret-like keys redacted. Ordinary pause/wait nodes can still report running. Live status overlays paused only for a detected top-level budget pause; pause_reason is safe, not internal policy/spend data. Poll with backoff; paused is nonterminal. Consumer resume is not supported.",
